00:05:28,235 --> 00:05:34,235
He's a dreamer, stuck in the real world.

2
00:10:56,470 --> 00:11:02,470
Griff the Invisible is a romance, comedy, drama film directed by Leon Ford.

3
00:16:24,705 --> 00:16:30,705
Griff, office worker by day, superhero by night, has his world turned upside down when he meets
Melody, a beautiful young scientist who shares his passion for the impossible.

4
